<title>THAILAND: Modern Home to issue debentures.</title>
<headline>Modern Home to issue debentures.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai property developer Modern Home Development Plc said on Tuesday it planned to issue 700 million (US$28 million) of three-year debentures that could be attached with warrants.</p>
<p>The debentures would be privately offerd to institutional investors. Other details would be disclosed later, the company said in a statement to the stock exchange.</p>
</text>
